{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And now come.</b> They hastened and agreed to kill him." "<b>And we shall say: a evil beast devoured him.</b> Lest he be wrathful and curse us." "<b>And we shall see what will become of his dreams.</b> The dreams that he told, which indicated that he would rise to greatness and rule over us — then we shall see that they are false dreams, for they will pass into nothing and perish without fulfillment."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:39.048769293Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}